   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 54pt;">For the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 28, 2026</em>, the Company has incurred $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511648" contextRef="d_2026-03-30_2026-06-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringCharges" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">16</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511649" contextRef="d_2025-12-29_2026-06-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringCharges" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">27</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand, respectively, in costs in connection with the disposal of SensiML. For the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 29, 2025</em>,&#160;the Company has incurred $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511652" contextRef="d_2025-03-31_2025-06-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringCharges" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">21</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511653" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-06-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringCharges" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">162</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand, respectively. These costs are primarily comprised of <em style="font: inherit;">one</em>-time termination benefits&#160;and related marketing and selling efforts and are split between the 'Restructuring Costs' line item in the Company's unaudited condensed consolidated statement of operations and in the table above. The Company does <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> expect total costs to be incurred in connection with the disposal of SensiML to differ materially from those already recognized.</p>
   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
