   <p style="text-indent: 53pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="text-indent: 53pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">Revenue streams from SensiML included Software as a Service (SaaS) subscriptions for development, per unit license fees when deployed in production, and proof-of-concept services.</p>
   <p style="text-indent: 53pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
