   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <div style="font-size:10pt">
    <div style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">
     <div style="font-variant: normal; text-indent: 54pt;">
       The Company grants restricted stock units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) and performance restricted stock units ("PRSUs") to employees and directors with various vesting terms. RSUs entitle the holder to receive, at&#160;
      <em style="font: inherit;">no</em>&#160;cost,&#160;
      <em style="font: inherit;">one</em>&#160;common share for each RSU as it vests. In general, the Company's policy is to withhold shares in settlement of employee tax withholding obligations upon the vesting of RSUs. The stock-based compensation expense related to RSUs and PRSUs from discontinued operations was approximately
      $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511664" contextRef="d_2026-03-30_2026-06-28_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction> for the&#160;
      <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 28, 2026</em> and&#160;
      $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511667" contextRef="d_2025-03-31_2025-06-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction> and&#160;(
      $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511668" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-06-29_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis-SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis-SensiMLMember" unitRef="USD" name="quik:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationSharebasedPaymentArrangementExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3" sign="-">32</ix:nonFraction> thousand) for the&#160;
      <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 29, 2025</em>, respectively.
     </div>
     <div style="font-variant: normal; text-indent: 54pt;">
       &#160;
     </div>
     <div style="font-variant: normal; text-indent: 54pt;">
      <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 53pt;">The following table provides cash flows from discontinued operations (in thousands):</p>
