   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 54pt;">The following table provides detail on payments related to financing arrangements for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 28, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;"> June 29, 2025</em> (in thousands):</p>
