   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 54pt;">Non-cash ROU assets related to operating leases included in the operating cash flows for continuing operations for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 28, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;"> June 29, 2025</em> were&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c149511747" contextRef="d_2025-12-29_2026-06-28" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortizationExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">157</ix:nonFraction> thousand and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511748" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-06-29" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortizationExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">144</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively.</p>
