   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 53pt;">The tables below present disaggregated revenues by geographical location. Revenue attributed to geographic location is based on the destination of the product or service. Substantially all revenues in North America were in the United States. Revenue in the United States was $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511886" contextRef="d_2026-03-30_2026-06-28_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">4.8</ix:nonFraction> million, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149511887" contextRef="d_2026-03-30_2026-06-28_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="Pure" name="quik:PercentageOfRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">88</ix:nonFraction>% of total revenue and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511888" contextRef="d_2025-12-29_2026-06-28_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">9.3</ix:nonFraction> million, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149511889" contextRef="d_2025-12-29_2026-06-28_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="Pure" name="quik:PercentageOfRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">88</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;of total revenue for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 28, 2026</em>, respectively, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511892" contextRef="d_2025-03-31_2025-06-29_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">2.9</ix:nonFraction> million, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149511893" contextRef="d_2025-03-31_2025-06-29_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="Pure" name="quik:PercentageOfRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="1">80</ix:nonFraction>% of total revenue and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149511894" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-06-29_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">6.8</ix:nonFraction> million, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149511895" contextRef="d_2024-12-30_2025-06-29_StatementGeographicalAxis-US" unitRef="Pure" name="quik:PercentageOfRevenue" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">85</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;of total revenue for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 29, 2025</em>, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 53pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 53pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">The following is a breakdown of revenue by destination (in thousands):&#160;</span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 53pt;">&#160;</p>
