  <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 54pt;">eFPGA IP revenue for the&#160;six months ended June 28, 2026 and June 29, 2025 was $8.6&#160;million and $6.2&#160;million, respectively, which was primarily professional services revenue.</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 54pt;">&#160;</p>
